# No Git LFS — deliberate. After purging the license-gated network_raw.zip
# (92 MB) from history, every tracked file is < 50 MB, which GitHub accepts
# as plain blobs. Plain blobs mean: no `git lfs` install/pull step for users,
# no LFS bandwidth quota breaking clones, and the data zips are actually
# INCLUDED when Zenodo archives the repo for the paper DOI (Zenodo's GitHub
# integration does not fetch LFS objects). Revisit only if a future artifact
# exceeds 100 MB and must be tracked.

# Text normalization (repo verified CRLF-free on 2026-08-08).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.R text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts — never diff, merge, or normalize.
*.zip binary
*.tif binary
*.gpkg binary
*.duckdb binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.xlsx binary
*.shp binary
*.shx binary
*.dbf binary
*.sbn binary
*.sbx binary
